2631_5457320628217598909_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FEJRETVETrMQ7kNvwHm69Yo&_nc_oc=AdpWtLv0gIxqOAStGdJLDX_CA4AbUnuH5O0H8GFc066sI-TNKSRdGO9kJvdEK6Ah7WQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR51Rut53CJOlEVR_ToaDUC6sdgec3Z7_9PzdQzTgYVIQ&oe=6AF0B20F"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1849839542992739", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823259_1849839546326072_4035769355140820369_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1dDC3jY967EQ7kNvwE7bj8t&_nc_oc=Adqv0x18mVm2p85MF-2KbT8Vn5RCkExCazG4CNaNHY8QUYBmhZS8upkdHKpV7rLD3RY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS7MxjzYwdLI0RNBT-unvjq_43EzKH6hXTczV4RO2uZTg&oe=6AF0B08D"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1767244957967222", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/585819904_1767244961300555_7554718931845842271_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=brphZw9QXYYQ7kNvwHumMtd&_nc_oc=Adqo3ruvqlPbGtcvvG7XmHKmajR2fiXtJbr6vRmGeJT6MMyMqt9GAkuETbxIEXoK-LI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRbPzwg3_6jDpGRPSy9AwCHGoTkcYLyi5V_wN7OrWs5hA&oe=6AF09F6B"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1189718949948137", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823802_1189718953281470_378474496700656237_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=guT0RIejFUUQ7kNvwF8aO7Z&_nc_oc=AdpTDOe-8p-VPEuLos-y8D0UOMR0Ox4SB-T9YnJnlGdukupa9yDJnIY1QivxPDCrZgM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRo18jh2kVA645jmh6FfT911TIekSVYcaTxsT-91MJRpA&oe=6AF08471"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1705557430462317", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823351_1705557437128983_2892223783731412237_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2C_1U251ktkQ7kNvwFdiRFY&_nc_oc=AdrH8y4VNYlrnIwUm6F74et_u4VgPaFaFxIv68MXvwgZfU1WCHAbmrfyfHKOQ2GBbwc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRz4DczU1lFgHKA2duHsxoiWg70RPD8X2yuPoGNnldUmA&oe=6AF0A845"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Feather Dodge", "keywords": ["dodge", "birds", "angry", "fly", "horizon"], "long_description": "Take Flight and Dodge the Flock in the Ultimate VR Reflex Challenge!\n\nSpread your wings and prepare for a high-speed airborne adventure in Feather Dodge! In this vibrant, fast-paced VR arcade experience, you control a swift little bird soaring through a dense, beautiful pine forest. Your mission is simple but intense: survive the incoming rush of eccentric, colorful birds flying straight your way!\n\nThe sky gets crowded quickly as a massive variety of round, stylized feathered rivals zoom past. Use your VR controllers to seamlessly weave left, right, up, and down to avoid sudden mid-air collisions. As the timer ticks up, the speed increases and the patterns become trickier, pushing your hand-eye coordination and spatial awareness to the absolute limit.\n\nHow long can you rule the forest canopy before the chaos catches up to you?\n\nKey Features:\nIntuitive VR Controls: Seamlessly guide your bird's flight path using your VR controllers for sharp, precise, and responsive dodging mechanics.\n\nFast-Paced Arcade Thrills: Experience a continuous wave of unpredictable incoming traffic that tests your reaction speed with every second.\n\nVibrant Stylized Visuals: Fly through a beautifully animated 3D forest environment filled with lush greenery, towering trees, and a colorful cast of expressive avian characters.\n\nDynamic High-Score Tracking: Watch your survival time climb in real-time, push past your limits, and try to break your personal record on every run.", "short_description": "Take flight and test your reflexes! Navigate a swift bird through a dense, endless forest, dodging incoming waves of colorful feathered rivals in this fast-paced VR arcade challenge."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nomanawan89.wixsite.com/brokenengineers", "deve